  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual\">Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual</a></i> </p><p>The Solari Crystal changes the width of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> blade, making it easier to intercept blaster bolts and other incoming ranged attacks. When you wield an attuned <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> with a Solari Crystal, you gain a +2 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force\">Force</a> bonus on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> checks to <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deflect\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deflect\">Deflect</a></b> incoming ranged attacks with the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deflect\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deflect\">Deflect</a></b> Talent. </p>",
